abstract: >-
  Official project documentation for FUNGO ($FUNGO), a community meme-token
  project intended for the Solana ecosystem. The repository records project
  disclosures, token information, technical verification status, risk
  disclosures, launch information, and community guidance. On-chain claims
  are identified as pending where they have not been independently verified.
keywords:
  - FUNGO
  - Solana
  - meme token
  - project documentation
  - transparency
